<title>CANADA: Derlan Industries Ltd names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Derlan Industries Ltd names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derlan Industries Ltd said on Thursday that David Williamson had been appointed senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Williamson's appointment is effective immediately, Derlan said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
